(measurement . ((gate-text . "Roadmap v1.00.26 §7 W2: resequence the DAG so fast-env starts after the lightweight lint job and concurrently with lint-quality, shortening time-to-test-start without weakening prepared-environment verification or its loud fallback; record the same-SHA before/after DAG timing checkpoint.")
